# --- Project-specific safety net ---------------------------------------------
# Raw field audio, screenshots and notes must never be committed.
# Only synthetic assets belong in prototype-assets/.
research/notes/*.private.md
prototype-assets/audio-samples/*.wav
prototype-assets/audio-samples/*.m4a
prototype-assets/audio-samples/*.mp3
*.recording.json
